      "title": "File:Mellifont Abbey Ireland Chapter House Doorway 1755.jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ad/Mellifont_Abbey_Ireland_Chapter_House_Doorway_1755.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Mellifont_Abbey_Ireland_Chapter_House_Doorway_1755.jpg",
